1. 3D models

The STL files under `docs/3d stl/` are the author's own designs, released
under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 rather than MIT:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Models designed by others are NOT redistributed here. Obtain them from
their original sources:

    Center Left / Right     cut and combined from purchased Cults3D models
      Enclosure               by Greenisland and Legarsdusofa
    ECM, TWA, UHF display     STL, gerbers and build guides belong to their
      panel projects            respective upstream projects
    Switch caps, knobs        The_Viper_Project (Cults3D), HispaPanel


2. F4ToSerial

The archived sketches under `F16_LEFT_AUX_MISC/backup/old/` include headers
from the F4ToSerial project by Music-Junky:

    https://github.com/Music-Junky/F4ToSerial

Those headers are not distributed in this repository. Obtain them from the
upstream project, where its own licence terms apply.
